stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Specify: task arrives
  Specify --> Design: the check-builder, a sub-agent on a different model that sees only the task, programs the checks once, from the library
  Design --> Bind: the designer writes the solution and tags its items by kind
  Bind --> Evaluate: engine maps the check-builder's roles onto the designer's kinds
  Evaluate --> Review: report with failures, what was examined, kinds no check touches, faults the checks missed
  Review --> Fix: the designer reviews checks and report and notes any concern, the checks stay as built
  Fix --> Evaluate
  Review --> Finish: nothing violated, every kind covered, every check caught its injected fault
  Finish --> [*]: final message plus the engine's evidence and the designer's concerns
